{"at": "2026-09-24T04:48:18.548607+00:00", "event_id": "01M38VWD3MP303X42S9AAAN2BX", "event_type": "DecisionPointOpened", "payload": {"actor_id": "cli", "actor_type": "human", "decision_point_id": "01M38VWD3KKSSTZNCK9V00N3TJ", "input_key": "fail_closed_locus", "mission_id": "01M38VVH6ZG5DX5ASSPBX61002", "mission_slug": "coord-read-fail-closed-01M38VVH", "mission_type": "software-dev", "options": ["Seam-level: resolution.py raises on unresolved/unmaterialised coord reads (both surfaces + all future readers inherit it; broader blast radius across seam callers)", "Reader-level: each reader checks the stamp/result and fails closed itself (localized, smaller blast radius; future readers not auto-protected)", "Hybrid: seam exposes an explicit unresolved/empty signal readers MUST handle; keep NONE raising, make UNMATERIALIZED a typed signal not a silent empty", "Other"], "origin_flow": "specify", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "phase": "SPECIFY", "question": "Where should the fail-closed contract for an unresolved/unmaterialised coord read live: at the placement read seam itself (resolution.py raises), or at each reader (they honour the PRIMARY/coord stamp and refuse)?", "recorded_at": "2026-09-24T04:48:18.548607Z", "run_id": "01M38VWD3KKSSTZNCK9V00N3TJ", "state_entered_at": "2026-09-24T04:48:18.547992Z", "step_id": "specify.contract.fail-closed-locus"}}
{"at": "2026-09-24T04:59:47.911767+00:00", "event_id": "01M38WHEA7TWCNVVH4HMFP7Y5B", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M38VWD3KKSSTZNCK9V00N3TJ", "final_answer": "Seam-level: the placement read seam (src/mission_runtime/resolution.py) raises a typed error on an unresolved/unmaterialised coord read (it already raises CoordinationBranchDeleted on NONE; extend that fail-closed posture to UNMATERIALIZED instead of returning empty PRIMARY on a coord-topology mission). Both surfaces (tracer-append writer, decision-ledger reader) and any future reader inherit fail-closed by construction. Mandatory blast-radius consequence: audit every caller of the read seam so each handles the raise correctly (refuse/materialise/resolve-to-authoritative) and none swallows it or is a non-coord caller that must keep working. NONE keeps raising; non-coord topologies (SINGLE_BRANCH/LANES route to primary) are unaffected.", "mission_id": "01M38VVH6ZG5DX5ASSPBX61002", "mission_slug": "coord-read-fail-closed-01M38VVH", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-09-24T04:59:47.911767Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M38VWD3KKSSTZNCK9V00N3TJ", "state_entered_at": "2026-09-24T04:59:47.903664Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
